@startuml UC-MG05-activity
' UC-MG05 Take over and handle a care exception, with the UC-SYS02 timeout escalation
' branch. Source: docs (use-case specification v3.0). Render: plantuml -tpng this file.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DiamondBorderColor #444444
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #888888
  TitleFontStyle bold
}
title UC-MG05  Take over and handle a care exception\n(with UC-SYS02 automatic escalation on timeout)

|System|
start
:Exception recorded
(caregiver report, elder SOS,
or missed check-in);
:Assemble the escalation chain **at runtime**
from severity, time of day and who is on duty;
:Assign the first responder,
start the response countdown (respondBy);
|Manager|
:Named task highlighted on the dashboard;

while (Taken over before the countdown expires?) is (no, timeout)
  |System|
  if (Next level on the chain?) then (yes)
    :UC-SYS02: hand over to the next level,
    notify old and new responder,
    log the timeout and its reason,
    start the next level's countdown;
  else (chain exhausted)
    :Mark UNRESOLVED_ESCALATED,
    pin to the top-level view,
    notify the family;
    stop
  endif
endwhile (yes)

|Manager|
:Take over: countdown stops,
elder background shown
(history, previous incidents);
:Contact the family (phone or push);
|Family|
if (Reached?) then (yes)
  :Agree the response with the manager;
  |Manager|
  :Log the contact as REACHED;
else (not reached)
  |Manager|
  :Log the contact as NOT REACHED
  and the reason;
  :Apply the standard playbook
  for this category;
endif
:Carry out the response;
if (Situation worsens?) then (yes)
  :Raise the severity;
  |System|
  :Re-assemble the chain for the new severity,
  the timeline continues, no new incident;
  |Manager|
endif
:Record the resolution and close the incident;
|System|
:Every step, with its timestamp, is in the incident timeline
(rejected and timed-out take-overs included);
stop
@enduml
